{"seq":2,"slug":"monitoring-debugging","title":"监控与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/operations/monitoring-debugging","wordCount":745,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"监控与调试\">监控与调试</h1><p>当子应用由不同团队独立部署时，一个用户遇到的 Bug 可能跨越多个子应用的边界——错误发生在 Product 子应用，但根因是 Shell 传递了错误的认证状态。微前端的监控与调试需要一套能「穿透子应用边界」的可观测性体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>微前端的可观测性分为三层：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户体验层] --&gt; B[应用运行层]&#10;    B --&gt; C[基础设施层]&#10;    A --&gt; A1[Core Web Vitals]&#10;    A --&gt; A2[子应用切换体验]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[JS 错误 + 调用栈]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[跨应用事件追踪]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[共享依赖状态]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[CDN/网络状态]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[Manifest 加载]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[Remote 健康检查]\">graph TD\n    A[用户体验层] --&gt; B[应用运行层]\n    B --&gt; C[基础设施层]\n    A --&gt; A1[Core Web Vitals]\n    A --&gt; A2[子应用切换体验]\n    B --&gt; B1[JS 错误 + 调用栈]\n    B --&gt; B2[跨应用事件追踪]\n    B --&gt; B3[共享依赖状态]\n    C --&gt; C1[CDN/网络状态]\n    C --&gt; C2[Manifest 加载]\n    C --&gt; C3[Remote 健康检查]</pre><h2 id=\"错误监控\">错误监控</h2><h3 id=\"错误归因-从调用栈定位责任方\">错误归因：从调用栈定位责任方</h3><p>微前端最常见的调试困难是「不知道错误属于哪个子应用」。解决方案是在错误上报时附加应用元数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Shell 统一的错误边界&#10;window.addEventListener(&#39;error&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  const errorSource = identifyAppFromStack(event.error?.stack);&#10;  reportError({&#10;    message: event.message,&#10;    stack: event.error?.stack,&#10;    app: errorSource || &#39;unknown&#39;,&#10;    url: location.href,&#10;    timestamp: Date.now(),&#10;  });&#10;});&#10;&#10;function identifyAppFromStack(stack?: string): string | null {&#10;  if (!stack) return null;&#10;  // 通过 chunk URL 中的应用标识判断来源&#10;  if (stack.includes(&#39;product.example.com&#39;)) return &#39;product&#39;;&#10;  if (stack.includes(&#39;order.example.com&#39;)) return &#39;order&#39;;&#10;  return &#39;shell&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Shell 统一的错误边界</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">window.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> errorSource</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> identifyAppFromStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.error?.stack);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  reportError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    message: event.message,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stack: event.error?.stack,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    app: errorSource </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'unknown'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    url: location.href,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    timestamp: Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> identifyAppFromStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stack) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 通过 chunk URL 中的应用标识判断来源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stack.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product.example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stack.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order.example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'order'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'shell'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"react-errorboundary-在微前端中的应用\">React ErrorBoundary 在微前端中的应用</h3><p>每个子应用入口包裹 ErrorBoundary，防止一个子应用崩溃影响整个页面：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Shell 中包裹每个子应用&#10;function MicroAppWrapper({ name, children }: Props) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;ErrorBoundary&#10;      fallback={&lt;AppCrashFallback appName={name} /&gt;}&#10;      onError={(error) =&gt; reportError({ app: name, error })}&#10;    &gt;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;AppLoading appName={name} /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        {children}&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;    &lt;/ErrorBoundary&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Shell 中包裹每个子应用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MicroAppWrapper</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">children</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Props</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ErrorBoundary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      fallback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{&#x3C;AppCrashFallback appName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{name} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      onError</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{(error) => </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reportError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense fallback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{&#x3C;AppLoading appName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{name} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">children</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ErrorBoundary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"mf-2-0-的-errorloadremote-hook\">MF 2.0 的 errorLoadRemote Hook</h3><p>Remote 加载失败时的降级策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { init } from &#39;@module-federation/enhanced/runtime&#39;;&#10;&#10;init({&#10;  name: &#39;host&#39;,&#10;  remotes: [{ name: &#39;product&#39;, entry: &#39;...&#39; }],&#10;  plugins: [{&#10;    name: &#39;error-handler&#39;,&#10;    errorLoadRemote({ id, error, from }) {&#10;      console.error(`[MF] Failed to load ${id} from ${from}:`, error);&#10;      // 返回降级组件&#10;      return { default: () =&gt; &lt;RemoteLoadError moduleName={id} /&gt; };&#10;    },&#10;  }],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { init } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@module-federation/enhanced/runtime'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'host'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  remotes: [{ name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, entry: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'...'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error-handler'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    errorLoadRemote</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`[MF] Failed to load ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">id</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} from ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, error);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 返回降级组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RemoteLoadError</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> moduleName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">={</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} /> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"分布式追踪\">分布式追踪</h2><p>跨子应用的用户操作需要统一的 Trace ID 贯穿：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Shell 生成 Trace ID，注入所有子应用&#10;const traceId = crypto.randomUUID();&#10;&#10;// 通过 props 注入&#10;registerMicroApps([&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;product&#39;,&#10;    props: { traceId, parentSpanId: &#39;shell-nav&#39; },&#10;  },&#10;]);&#10;&#10;// 子应用中创建子 Span&#10;function ProductList({ traceId, parentSpanId }: Props) {&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    const span = tracer.startSpan(&#39;product-list-render&#39;, {&#10;      traceId,&#10;      parentSpanId,&#10;    });&#10;    // ... render logic&#10;    span.end();&#10;  }, []);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Shell 生成 Trace ID，注入所有子应用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> traceId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crypto.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">randomUUID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 通过 props 注入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">registerMicroApps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    props: { traceId, parentSpanId: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'shell-nav'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 子应用中创建子 Span</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProductList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">traceId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">parentSpanId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Props</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> span</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startSpan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product-list-render'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      traceId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      parentSpanId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // ... render logic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>追踪维度</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>数据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>页面导航</td>\n<td>Performance Navigation Timing</td>\n<td>路由切换耗时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子应用生命周期</td>\n<td>自定义 Span</td>\n<td>mount/unmount 耗时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Remote 加载</td>\n<td>MF Runtime Hook</td>\n<td>模块加载耗时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨应用通信</td>\n<td>Event Bus 拦截</td>\n<td>事件延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 调用</td>\n<td>fetch/XHR 拦截</td>\n<td>请求耗时与状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mf-2-0-chrome-devtools-扩展\">MF 2.0 Chrome DevTools 扩展</h2><p>Module Federation 2.0 提供的官方 Chrome 扩展是调试微前端的核心工具：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>依赖图可视化</strong>：展示 Host/Remote 之间的模块依赖关系</li>\n<li><strong>共享依赖审计</strong>：查看哪些依赖被共享、哪些被重复加载</li>\n<li><strong>Manifest 检查</strong>：实时查看各 Remote 的 manifest 内容与版本</li>\n<li><strong>加载时序</strong>：可视化模块加载的瀑布图</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"side-effect-scanner\">Side Effect Scanner</h2><p>MF 2.0 引入的静态分析工具，在集成前检测 Remote 模块的副作用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 扫描 Remote 产物的副作用&#10;npx @module-federation/scanner \\&#10;  --entry ./dist/remoteEntry.js \\&#10;  --check global-vars,event-listeners,css-scope&#10;&#10;# 输出示例&#10;# ⚠️ Global variable: window.ProductConfig (set in ProductList chunk)&#10;# ⚠️ CSS selector: .button (no scope prefix, may conflict)&#10;# ✓ No unscoped event listeners detected\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 扫描 Remote 产物的副作用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @module-federation/scanner</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --entry</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./dist/remoteEntry.js</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --check</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> global-vars,event-listeners,css-scope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ⚠️ Global variable: window.ProductConfig (set in ProductList chunk)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ⚠️ CSS selector: .button (no scope prefix, may conflict)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ✓ No unscoped event listeners detected</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"日志与告警策略\">日志与告警策略</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>日志级别</th>\n<th>告警阈值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Remote 加载失败</td>\n<td>ERROR</td>\n<td>连续 3 次 → P1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Remote 加载慢</td>\n<td>WARN</td>\n<td>&gt; 2s → P2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shared 版本不兼容</td>\n<td>ERROR</td>\n<td>任何一次 → P1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSS 全局污染</td>\n<td>WARN</td>\n<td>检测到 → P3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子应用 mount 失败</td>\n<td>ERROR</td>\n<td>连续 2 次 → P1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子应用 unmount 超时</td>\n<td>WARN</td>\n<td>&gt; 5s → P2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"生产环境调试技巧\">生产环境调试技巧</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>Source Map 上传到错误监控平台</strong>（Sentry/LogRocket），不在 CDN 暴露</li>\n<li><strong>Feature Flag 控制 debug 模式</strong>：特定用户可开启详细日志</li>\n<li><strong>MF manifest 版本号</strong>：在错误上报中附加当前加载的 manifest 版本</li>\n<li><strong>时间旅行调试</strong>：通过切换 manifest 版本复现历史问题</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>错误归因需要从调用栈中提取子应用标识</li>\n<li>ErrorBoundary 隔离子应用崩溃，防止全局白屏</li>\n<li>分布式 Trace ID 贯穿子应用边界</li>\n<li>MF 2.0 Chrome DevTools 扩展是运行时调试的核心工具</li>\n<li>Side Effect Scanner 在集成前发现潜在冲突</li>\n<li>告警策略按 Remote 加载 / Shared 兼容 / mount 成功率分级</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 下一篇：<a href=\"migration-strategy\">迁移策略</a> — 从单体到微前端的渐进式迁移路径</li>\n<li>跨 hub 参考：<a href=\"../frontend-observability\">前端可观测性 hub</a> — 通用的前端监控体系建设</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"监控与调试","id":"监控与调试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"错误监控","id":"错误监控"},{"level":3,"text":"错误归因：从调用栈定位责任方","id":"错误归因-从调用栈定位责任方"},{"level":3,"text":"React ErrorBoundary 在微前端中的应用","id":"react-errorboundary-在微前端中的应用"},{"level":3,"text":"MF 2.0 的 errorLoadRemote Hook","id":"mf-2-0-的-errorloadremote-hook"},{"level":2,"text":"分布式追踪","id":"分布式追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"MF 2.0 Chrome DevTools 扩展","id":"mf-2-0-chrome-devtools-扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"Side Effect Scanner","id":"side-effect-scanner"},{"level":2,"text":"日志与告警策略","id":"日志与告警策略"},{"level":2,"text":"生产环境调试技巧","id":"生产环境调试技巧"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/operations/performance-optimization"},"next":{"title":"迁移策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/operations/migration-strategy"}}